{"headword":"קָצִיר","parent_lexicon":"BDB Dictionary","content":{"senses":[{"definition":"<strong>n.m.</strong> <sup><a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 8:20\" href=\"/Jeremiah.8.20\">Je 8:20</a></sup> harvesting, harvest <strong>(</strong>cf. Lag<sup>BN 173</sup><strong>)</strong>;—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">ק׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 45:6\" href=\"/Genesis.45.6\">Gn 45:6</a> +, cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">קְצִיר</span> <a data-ref=\"Judges 15:1\" href=\"/Judges.15.1\">Ju 15:1</a> +; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">קְצִירְךָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 19:9\" href=\"/Leviticus.19.9\">Lv 19:9</a> +, etc.;—<em>harvest:</em>"},{"senses":[{"definition":"process of <em>harvesting</em>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 45:6\" href=\"/Genesis.45.6\">Gn 45:6</a> (E; + <span dir=\"rtl\">חָרִישׁ</span>), <a data-ref=\"Ruth 2:21\" href=\"/Ruth.2.21\">Ru 2:21</a>."}],"num":"1."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>what is reaped, harvested, crop</em>, spec. of grain: <a data-ref=\"Genesis 8:22\" href=\"/Genesis.8.22\">Gn 8:22</a> (+ <span dir=\"rtl\">זֶרַע</span>; J), <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 17:11\" href=\"/Isaiah.17.11\">Is 17:11</a> (fig.; cf. <a data-ref=\"BDB, נוּד\" href=\"/BDB,_נוּד\", dir=\"rtl\">נוד</a>; ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">זֶרַע</span>), <span dir=\"rtl\">ק׳ יְאֹר</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 23:3\" href=\"/Isaiah.23.3\">23:3</a> (‖ id.) i.e. exported grain of Egypt; <span dir=\"rtl\">קְ׳ חִטִּים</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 34:22\" href=\"/Exodus.34.22\">Ex 34:22</a> (JE), ins. also <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 24:15\" href=\"/II_Samuel.24.15\">2 S 24:15</a> (𝔊 Th We Dr al.), <span dir=\"rtl\">לֶקֶט ק׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 19:9\" href=\"/Leviticus.19.9\">Lv 19:9b</a>; <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 23:22\" href=\"/Leviticus.23.22\">23:22b</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">ק׳</span> as eaten <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 5:17\" href=\"/Jeremiah.5.17\">Je 5:17</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 5:5\" href=\"/Job.5.5\">Jb 5:5</a> (but read here <span dir=\"rtl\">קָֽצְרוּ</span> 𝔊 Me Bu al., cf. Bev<sup>JPhil. xxvi.304</sup>); as acc. cogn. c. <